=4 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Baren-Moren} (H-7) to begin the quest and get the {k:New model hat}.
* Mandatory NPCs you need to show the hat to:
** {n:Bondada |Bondada} inside the hat shop.
** {n:Honoi-Gomoi} in the upper portion of Gingerberry Grove (E-7) (South Map).
*** Located in the residence to the right, however, you must go around the back of the house and up the stairs in order to meet him.
** {n:Kenapa-Keppa} inside the most southern door of the Rhinostery (South Map).
** {n:Clais} on the wooden bridge leading to the Rarab's Tail Hostelery / Timbre Timbers Tavern G-10 (North Map).
** {n:Kyume-Romeh} in the Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10) (North Map).
** {n:Tosuka-Porika} in the east Optistery building (G-8) (North Map).
** {n:Pechiru-Mashiru} in the east Aurastery building (L-6) (North Map).
** {n:Machitata} near the Mog House (L-11) (North Map).
* The more NPCs you talk to, the greater your final reward, up to a maximum of 200 gil and a Windshear Hat.
** <20 NPCs: You will not get credit or complete the quest
** 20~29 NPCs: 50 gil, no hat.
** 30~39 NPCs: 120 gil, no hat.
** 40~79 NPCs: 150 gil and a Windshear Hat.
** 80+ NPCS: 200 gil and a Windshear Hat.
* After you have shown the hat to the eight mandatory NPCs and 12 additional NPCs (i.e. 20 total), speak to {n:Baren-Moren} again to hang-up the hat which completes the quest.
* Zoning will reset any NPC spoken to before turning the hat in.

